## Priority and publication decisions

The finite-chain-ring trichotomy, its leading-layer dense-codebook synthesis, the two-setting theorem and the exact modal query bounds remain **candidate novelty after targeted search**, not established priority. The fresh literature audit downgrades generic Bell/GHZ/no-cloning/teleportation, ordinary base change, circulants, matrix-rank facts, orthogonal-span ingredients and faithful-probability obstructions to background or supporting material. In particular, Schumacher and Westmoreland already distinguish weak from strong probability resolutions; the tested faithful-completion obstruction is not a new foundational discovery. [literature/ANNOTATED_BIBLIOGRAPHY.md]

P01 should be drafted first as a contract-explicit classification/resource paper. P02 follows as a focused exact-query article or note, with its own dedicated priority check. Paper B receives the S1/S2 mechanism and equality findings now, but any positive runtime claim waits for a frozen matched natural-workload campaign. A separate folding article, a separate LM bridge article and a broad laboratory article are deferred.

Nothing prevents beginning mathematically responsible drafts now. Submission-strength novelty language, confirmatory compiler claims and any claim of a complete operational theory require the additional work in [the action plan](handoff/NEXT_ACTIONS.md).
